# Greybox Mobile Idle Art Bible

Generator credit: Greybox + Noor Designer. AI-assisted, human-directed.

## Pillars

- One-hand readability at phone distance.
- Upgrade affordances stay clear without aggressive pressure.
- Economy feedback feels generous before monetization appears.

## Palette

- Paper Warm: #FAFAF7
- Ink UI: #0A0A0D
- Farm Green: #2ECC71
- Spark Button: #FF6B35
- Soft Reward: #F4C95D
- Focus Cyan: #3CC2E0
- Alert Red: #E94B3C

## Materials

Use flat station materials, soft shadows, and high-contrast button states. The
rewarded-ad callout must remain optional and visually secondary to core progress.
